== Usage ==
The player can click or hold down right-click to shoot {{Item|Snowball}}s. The {{Item|Snowball}}s move at a faster rate than those shot by the {{Item|Frosty the Snow Cannon|text=Cannon}} and {{Item|Frosty the Snow Cannon|text=Blaster}}.

'''Frosty the Howitzer''' has a capacity of {{Item|Snowball|amount=10000}}s. The ammo count is shown in the description and can be shown by left clicking while holding '''Frosty the Howitzer'''. The player can refill their ammo by interacting with {{NPCSprite|Frosty}} for {{c|1}} per {{Item|Snowball}} missing. If the player does not meet the {{c}} requirement, {{NPCSprite|Frosty}} will refill '''Frosty the Howitzer''' based on the amount of {{c}} the player has.

If the player wears {{Item|Snow Suit Armor|text=Snow Suit}} or {{Item|Nutcracker Armor}}, '''Frosty the Howitzer''' gains infinite ammo.

A {{Mythic}} {{Item|Snowman Pet}} has a {{Green|50%}} chance to double damage done by {{Item|Snowball}}s.

== Trivia ==
*'''Frosty the Howitzer''' bears a striking resemblance to the [[fandom:villains:Ice_King|Ice King]] from Adventure Time.
*The word ''Howitzer'' is one of the few words that come from the Czech language. The Czech word for Howitzer is "Houfnice" with the "houf" being the Czech archaic word for "crowd", which comes from the German word with the same meaning, "Hūfe".

